flowchart TD
    A[Anomaly Detected] --> B[Contain Runtime Path]
    B --> C[Revoke Active Capabilities]
    C --> D[Preserve Evidence]
    D --> E[Escalate to Incident Roles]
    E --> F{Recovery Decision}
    F -- Resume with constraints --> G[Controlled Resume]
    F -- Deny and close --> H[Closed with findings]
    F -- Rollback --> I[Rollback and reassess]
